1
00:00:00,033 --> 00:00:01,667
Kalau cakap pasal ubat

2
00:00:01,667 --> 00:00:02,967
yang stabilkan mood,

3
00:00:02,967 --> 00:00:04,733
ramai yang tahu ubat litium je.

4
00:00:04,733 --> 00:00:06,433
Tapi sebenarnya ada satu lagi ubat

5
00:00:06,433 --> 00:00:08,767
yang kita boleh kata underrated,

6
00:00:08,767 --> 00:00:10,667
tapi power sebenarnya,

7
00:00:10,667 --> 00:00:12,100
iaitu Lamotrigine.

8
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:13,233
Pernah dengar tak pasal ubat ni?

9
00:00:13,233 --> 00:00:14,600
Lamotrigine ni dia famous

10
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:16,367
untuk stabilkan mood,

11
00:00:16,367 --> 00:00:19,033
especially dalam penyakit bipolar disorder.

12
00:00:19,033 --> 00:00:21,300
Terutamanya dalam episod kemurunganlah.

13
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:23,167
Dan risiko kenaikan berat badan

14
00:00:23,167 --> 00:00:23,967
dia sangat rendah.

15
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:24,867
Sebab tu ramai pasien

16
00:00:24,867 --> 00:00:26,100
yang suka dengan ubat ni.

17
00:00:26,100 --> 00:00:27,367
Ubat ni juga dia tak buat

18
00:00:27,367 --> 00:00:28,467
rasa mengantuk sangat.

19
00:00:28,467 --> 00:00:30,033
Jadi ramai orang masih lagi

20
00:00:30,033 --> 00:00:31,600
boleh function macam biasa

21
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:32,267
pada siang hari,

22
00:00:32,267 --> 00:00:34,733
dan sesuai untuk long-term use,

23
00:00:34,733 --> 00:00:36,300
tapi dengan monitoring doktorlah.

24
00:00:36,300 --> 00:00:37,433
Seperti biasa,

25
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:39,133
setiap ubat pun ada keburukan

26
00:00:39,133 --> 00:00:40,367
dan side effect dia juga.

27
00:00:40,367 --> 00:00:41,433
Ubat ni dia kena start

28
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:42,700
dengan dos yang rendah,

29
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,567
perlahan-lahan kena titrate naik,

30
00:00:44,567 --> 00:00:46,000
sebab ada risiko untuk

31
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,333
ruam kulit yang serius.

32
00:00:47,333 --> 00:00:48,633
Kita panggil sebagai

33
00:00:48,633 --> 00:00:50,233
Stevens-Johnson syndrome.

34
00:00:50,233 --> 00:00:51,267
Dia rare, tapi

35
00:00:51,267 --> 00:00:52,767
boleh berlakulah dengan ubat ni.

36
00:00:52,767 --> 00:00:54,400
Dan boleh menyebabkan side effect

37
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:55,600
yang biasalah, seperti ubat lain,

38
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:57,167
seperti pening kepala,

39
00:00:57,167 --> 00:00:58,767
loya ataupun susah tidur.

40
00:00:58,767 --> 00:00:59,600
Dan ubat ni juga

41
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,700
dia tak begitu kuat

42
00:01:00,700 --> 00:01:02,433
untuk rawat fasa mania tu.

43
00:01:02,433 --> 00:01:03,067
Dia lebih kepada

44
00:01:03,067 --> 00:01:04,900
nak elak kemurungan tu datang balik.

45
00:01:04,900 --> 00:01:06,167
Sama seperti ubat lain,

46
00:01:06,167 --> 00:01:07,233
jangan stop sendiri

47
00:01:07,233 --> 00:01:08,467
tanpa advice doktor.

48
00:01:08,467 --> 00:01:09,233
Tapi kena ingat,

49
00:01:09,233 --> 00:01:10,367
ubat ni juga ada

50
00:01:10,367 --> 00:01:11,733
cara guna dia yang selamat.

51
00:01:11,733 --> 00:01:12,933
Kalau anda rasa struggle

52
00:01:12,933 --> 00:01:14,133
dengan mood swing,

53
00:01:14,133 --> 00:01:14,833
boleh set appointment

54
00:01:14,833 --> 00:01:15,733
dengan saya dekat Nilai.

55
00:01:15,733 --> 00:01:17,200
Kita sembang santai dahulu

56
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,467
sebelum kita decide

57
00:01:18,467 --> 00:01:19,833
plan terbaik untuk anda.

58
00:01:19,833 --> 00:01:20,433
Apa persoalan,

59
00:01:20,433 --> 00:01:21,367
boleh tanya di ruang komen.

60
00:01:21,367 --> 00:01:22,033
Take care.
